y^D​F​L=∑i=0ni⋅Softmax​(wi)=∑i=0ni⋅ewi∑j=0newj\hat{y}_{DFL}=\sum_{i=0}^{n}i\cdot\text{Softmax}(w_{i})=\sum_{i=0}^{n}i\cdot\frac{e^{w_{i}}}{\sum_{j=0}^{n}e^{w_{j}}}

This operation involves repeated exponential (exe^{x}) and division calculations, which are computationally expensive on integer-arithmetic edge accelerators [[41](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2601.12882#bib.bib29 "BitFusion: bit-level pipelined multiplication and accumulation for efficient deep learning")].

